msgid "文件系统与路径"
msgstr "Filesystems and paths"

msgid "命名与存储"
msgstr "Naming and storage"

msgid ""
"来宾使用 Unix 根目录语义，源码路径不是来宾路径。默认 root 为 ext4， ESP 独立使用 FAT32；数据分区还可使用已实现的 ext2、FAT32、exFAT 等路径。 "
"支持格式不代表所有 POSIX 权限、崩溃恢复或第三方工具组合均已认证。 GPT 分区名使用 UTF-16，界面文本使用 UTF-8。 具体磁盘管理限制见 "
":doc:`../applications/diskmgr`。"
msgstr ""
"Guests use Unix root-directory semantics; source paths are not guest paths. The default root is "
"ext4, with a separate FAT32 ESP. Data partitions may also use implemented ext2, FAT32, exFAT, and "
"other paths. Format support does not certify every POSIX permission, crash-recovery behavior, or "
"third-party tool combination. GPT partition names use UTF-16 and UI text uses UTF-8. For disk-"
"management limits, see :doc:`../applications/diskmgr`."

msgid "调用规则"
msgstr "Calling rules"

msgid ""
"文件操作处理短读短写、EOF、EINTR、EAGAIN、权限与最终错误；ret==0 不能代替累计字节校验。路径解析区分符号链接、挂载边界和打开的对象身份。 "
"同目录临时文件、fsync、rename 可发布单文件，不能保证任意多个文件整体回滚。 目录 fsync 不是“同步目录下全部文件”的替代品。"
msgstr ""
"File operations must handle short reads/writes, EOF, EINTR, EAGAIN, permissions, and final errors;"
" ret==0 does not replace cumulative byte-count checks. Path resolution distinguishes symlinks, "
"mount boundaries, and opened-object identity. A same-directory temporary file, fsync, and rename "
"can publish one file, but do not guarantee rollback of an arbitrary set of files as a whole. "
"Directory fsync does not replace synchronizing all files within that directory."

msgid ""
"目录枚举使用 Linux ``getdents64``，应用优先使用 POSIX ``opendir/readdir``。 对目录调用 ``read`` 返回 ``EISDIR``。兼容接口 "
"``reliefos_readdir`` 和 ``reliefos_list_dir`` 在运行库内适配标准目录记录，保留发布的结构与符号别名； "
"不再依赖内核返回私有定长目录记录。调用方应串行操作共享目录描述符的位置。 超过旧定长名称容量时明确返回 ``ENAMETOOLONG``，长名称应使用 POSIX 接口。"
msgstr ""
"Directory enumeration uses Linux ``getdents64``; applications should prefer POSIX "
"``opendir/readdir``. Calling ``read`` on a directory returns ``EISDIR``. Compatibility interfaces "
"``reliefos_readdir`` and ``reliefos_list_dir`` adapt standard directory records inside the "
"runtime, preserving published structures and symbol aliases. They no longer depend on private "
"fixed-size directory records from the kernel. Callers should serialize position changes on shared "
"directory descriptors. Names exceeding the old fixed capacity explicitly return ``ENAMETOOLONG``; "
"use POSIX interfaces for long names."

msgid "块设备操作还需逻辑扇区、只读状态、挂载冲突及分区身份验证。热插拔和同名 媒体替换有未覆盖边界，应保持设备连接并在破坏性操作前再次核对。"
msgstr ""
"Block-device operations also require checks of logical sectors, read-only status, mount conflicts,"
" and partition identity. Hot-plugging and replacement with same-named media have uncovered "
"boundaries; keep devices connected and recheck before destructive operations."
